# Router

Thin transport: `{context}.contract.ts` → middleware → [api](./api.mdc).

## Do

- Contract: `oc.input` / `oc.output`, Zod from `@workspace/validation`
- `implement({context}Contract).$context<OrpcContext>()`
- Always `.use(mapAppErrorMiddleware)`
- Auth: `.use(authedMiddleware)` when needed
- Handler only calls `{context}.api.ts`

## Don't

- New Repository / UseCase / SQL / rules

```ts
const os = implement(authContract).$context<OrpcContext>().use(mapAppErrorMiddleware);

export const authRouter = os.router({
  signUp: os.signUp.handler(async ({ input }) => await signUp(input)),
});
```
